		line=1206,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030210"},
		line=1206,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Today is the day Warren Valentine, governor-general of the Republic, returns to his home country.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"At Miyoshi, a large gathering of warriors is watching the ceremony live on television.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Warren is giving his departure speech on screen at this very moment.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hate to admit it, but he sure knows what he's doing.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. He puts himself together impeccably.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“According to Shino, he's way more interested in his appearance and his finances than going into battle.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Apparently he's heading back to the Republic in order to bow and scrape to some politicians.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I take it back. What a pathetic excuse for a soldier.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But it's all thanks to him that we can stage our uprising.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Warren's speech comes to a close as we idly chatter amongst ourselves.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Kanami proceeds to take his place at the podium.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Every warrior in the room immediately sits up a little straighter.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"She expressionlessly recites the speech that Okonogi likely wrote for her.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"The gist of it is, “We will dearly miss Warren's presence, but Okonogi and I will safeguard the Empire until his return.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Upon finishing her speech, however, she makes no move to leave the stage.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"She looks down for several seconds, seemingly deep in thought.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"When she looks up once again, it's as thought an entirely different person is staring at us.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wait a minute...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is she playing at?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I would take this opportunity to make an important declaration to you, the people of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“By all rights, I am not the person who ought to be standing upon this stage.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The reason being that the blood of the Imperial Family does not flow through my veins!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"A deathly silence descends upon the restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Everyone is staring at the screen in rapt disbelief.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am nothing but an outright impostor placed upon the throne by Okonogi Tokihiko!”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Nothing but a puppet designed to perpetuate his grasp on power!”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am─!”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"The television screen suddenly cuts to an image of a placid blue sky.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"The upbeat accompanying tune echoes throughout the oppressively silent restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Was this part of the plan?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"If it was, that's news to me.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"I can't imagine that Elsa would've put her up to this, so it's probably safe to assume that Kanami acted of her own volition.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"...Why would you do this, Kanami?",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Why would you throw Operation Bellflower out the window?",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"The dumbfounded warriors slowly come to their senses and the restaurant begins buzzing with commotion.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"However, unlike their reaction to the announcement of Empress Hisui's marriage, each of their faces is a mask of unease.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The Empress they swore fealty to has just declared herself an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Rather than anger or dejection, what comes first is sheer bewilderment.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I will have order!”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"A single shout from Hotori silences the warriors at once.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“On the matter of Empress Hisui's declaration just now, I will personally gather all necessary information.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I will report the results at headquarters tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Until then, you are to refrain from taking any action based on independent conjecture. That is all.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Now that our chairman has outlined a preliminary plan of action, the restaurant regains some measure of composure.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We need to go to headquarters.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is a real problem.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What the heck is that girl thinking!?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Our rampant speculation here isn't going to get us anywhere.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"We need to go to headquarters immediately and start gathering information.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehehee, this has become quite the predicament.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is no laughing matter. I swear...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Escort Her Majesty to the standby room!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now! Get a damn move on!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Three of my men move to drag Empress Hisui off the stage.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Let me go! The people need to hear what I have to say!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please! Let me speak!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Her desperate pleas recede into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“(What the hell is she doing? Operation Bellflower is done for now!)”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I curse her with all my heart.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I knew she could be unfathomable at times, but I never expected her to pull something like this.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Whatever. I'll just need to take the time to have a nice, long chat with her later.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I pull myself back together and survey the venue.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Perhaps because most of the visitors in attendance are Republicans, there is no major uproar.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"At the very least, they clearly have the good sense to not make a scene in front of Warren.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"The most they're doing is whispering in hushed tones to the people seated around them.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“My apologies for subjecting you all to such an unsightly spectacle.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Her Majesty has been under great strain as of late, and it seems she has unfortunately succumbed to a bout of hysterical delusion.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“How truly heartbreaking.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Warren isn't shaken in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“It seems this is no time for me to be taking it easy back on the mainland.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“With apologies to all those gathered, this ceremony will regrettably be adjourned here.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“We will proceed with the luncheon as planned, so I do hope you might still enjoy yourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Warren succinctly puts an end to the ceremony and steps down from the stage.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“A thousand pardons, Your Excellency.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Okonogi obsequiously sidles up to Warren.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Am I to take the Empress's words at face value?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Perish the thought!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It is just as Your Excellency said! Her Majesty's demanding schedule has rendered her unable to distinguish between reality and delusion.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Let's pray for your sake that that's the truth.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“We'll arrange an escort for you back to the Imperial Palace. Ready a car.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Republican soldiers surround Okonogi on both sides and practically drag him away from the venue.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Elsa, take care of the rest.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Investigate the Empress and Okonogi, and report back to me at once.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Without another word, Warren strides into the government-general.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Now that his return has been canceled, Operation Bellflower will have to be scrapped.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"It's all the way back to the drawing board for me.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"But first, I should have a little chat with Empress Hisui...",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Two hours later─",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I get around to paying Empress Hisui a visit.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"After her outburst at the ceremony, I had her taken away to a certain guest room in the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"A room with a locked door and no windows.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“How do you find the accommodations?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Empress Hisui sets the book she'd been reading down and turns to face me.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Very pleasant, thank you. I'm quite used to being caged up, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Still feeling comfortable enough to talk back, are we?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"I drag over a spare chair and sit down in front of Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well then, let's hear what you have to say for yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I seem to have caused you some trouble. For that, I do apologize.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's putting it awfully lightly.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thanks to you, Operation Bellflower has almost entirely gone up in smoke.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why would you go and expose yourself now all times?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“To protect Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“From what?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Does nothing come to mind?”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Empress Hisui directs a withering stare at me.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“From you, Elsa-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have no idea what you're talking about.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Shall I spell it out for you? You still fully intend to round up all the warriors, do you not?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Seems like she's seen right through me.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"But I don't let the agitation show on my face.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You seriously believed what Okonogi told you? You must be out of your mind.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It is fine and well if you wish to preserve your dignity.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“At the very least, the operation is already beyond saving.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't you get it? You've dashed the warriors' plans─your\nOnii-sama's plans.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I did what I needed to protect Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I did all of it of my own accord, all for Onii-sama's sake.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And what about all the citizens who trusted you?!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Regardless of your bloodline, you're still the Empress to those people!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“That is none of my concern.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If I truly feared the judgment of the people, I would not be standing where I am now.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wh─This is your own country you're talking about!”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama, do you seriously hope to convince me with your half-baked sense of justice?”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Spout all that you will about democracy─ it is still clear as day that the Republic is nothing but a violent conqueror.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“And you yourself live off the blood of innocent victims.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you truly cared for the Empire, why not go see the governor-general right this minute and persuade him to liberate this country?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you refuse to do even that, then you're no better than him.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Kh!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"At the very last moment, I manage to suppress my outburst of emotions with reason.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"She's absolutely right.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"But coming from someone as powerless as her, even the soundest arguments in the world might as well be noise.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"And yet, Empress Hisui has proven that she's willing to stake her own life on her convictions.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Just a few hours ago, she dared to do just that.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"In light of that, her argument carries a weight all its own.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“...You're right.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In the end... I never cared about anything but myself.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Finally admitting it, I take a deep breath to collect myself.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"I've never felt more pathetic.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"I've never felt more pathetic, but after being so thoroughly exposed, I also feel indescribably refreshed.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But that's exactly why I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" democratize the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Not for the sake of the Empire or its people, but out of my own selfishness.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“If you'd simply admitted that from the start, I believe things would never have gotten this complicated.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Just like Tokita-kun, her smile brings to mind an invigorating sea breeze.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"It has nothing to do with the fact that they are brother and sister.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Rather, it must be the smile that comes from a heart free of hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"I must have a weakness for the Tokita siblings.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If the circumstances permit it, I still want you to continue working with me to bring democracy to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As long as no danger comes to Onii-sama, I am happy to comply.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Onii-sama always comes first, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Isn't it nice how easy I am to understand?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“However, I can serve as Empress no longer.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The chancellor and the governor-general are surely furious, and the people would never accept me now.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, I'm sure Okonogi and Warren are pissed.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But I think all that the people want is for this whole thing to blow over like nothing ever happened.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How so? I am naught but an impostor.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But they want to believe that you're the real deal.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's just how popular you are.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"The people are obviously shaken, but it hasn't manifested into unrest and rioting as of yet.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"As long as no definitive proof comes to light, they'll accept as fact whatever conclusion they want.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"In other words, there's no evidence Empress Hisui is an impostor, so she must be real.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am not sure how to feel. To think that I've exposed the truth, yet nobody will believe me.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“People are happy to close their ears to inconvenient truths.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"I stand up.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That said, the situation is still in flux.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We'll need to be especially wary of what Okonogi or Warren might do.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I can't guarantee that nothing will happen to you, so lay low in here for the time being.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes, thank you for everything.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Once I ensure that Empress Hisui has agreed to stay put, I leave the room.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"The next day, all the warriors gather at headquarters to hear the news.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"They're trying their best not to show it, but everyone seems shaken.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"The Empress just declared herself an impostor, so I can hardly blame them.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Even Hotori and I would be in a panic right now if we didn't know about Akari.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I remember it took you quite some time before you would accept Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's totally reasonable.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The deeper your fealty towards Her Majesty, the more grieved you'd naturally be.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Hotori stands up and faces the assemblage of warriors with a composed expression.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you all for gathering here.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“All of you surely had to endure a very trying night.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It is especially during times like these that we must be prudent.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“First, we will have Tokita report on the situation as we know it.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"I stand up and take Hotori's place.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will report on the veracity of Her Majesty's claims momentarily.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But first, I have the following intelligence regarding Warren and Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Warren has canceled his return to his home country. Naturally, this means the Republic's aircraft carrier remains anchored at sea.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Okonogi is holed up in the Imperial Palace, but in all likelihood, this is under the Republic's duress.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Republican forces guarding the Imperial Palace have more than doubled. Troops in many other sectors are also on high alert.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Next, regarding Her Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Everyone's expressions tighten at once.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her Majesty is presently being housed within the Republican Government-General.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The stated purpose is to ensure her safety, but she is effectively being imprisoned.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This information comes directly from Elsa, so it is exceptionally credible.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Regarding the truth behind Her Majesty's claims...”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"I briefly pause, looking over all the watchful eyes hanging on to my words.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At present, no evidence has come to light which suggests that Her Majesty is indeed an impostor.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"After discussing it with Hotori and Akari, this is the wording we settled on.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"If the warriors lose their loyalty to Empress Hisui, not only will Operation Bellflower fall apart, the unity of the Blades will also be threatened.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"In the end, we decided to not do anything that would actively cast doubt on Empress Hisui's identity.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"How ironic that I would denounce impersonating the Empress as a horrible crime, only to turn around and work to cover up the truth.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I shall now detail our plans moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our uprising will be temporarily postponed until the situation stabilizes.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"A chorus of sighs goes up across the room, but no objections are raised.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"In the first place, Empress Hisui's call to action for the Sworn Blades was an integral aspect of Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"With all the uncertainty looming over Empress Hisui's position, we can't move forward with our plan.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I see there are no objections.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now, with that in mind...”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"The headquarters begins buzzing with commotion before Hotori is able to continue.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's happened?”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"A nearby warrior answers her.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"News has come in of Okonogi's sudden death.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"He was apparently found dead early this morning, and the cause is still under investigation.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Republic decided to put him down, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sounds like it.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So that man is finally dead...”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If only I could have...”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Biting her lip, Akari hangs her head.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"She must be mourning the fact that she failed to personally avenge her mother's death.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I beg your leave!”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Koyuzu flies into headquarters in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Urgent report from our operatives.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“The Government-General is plotting to murder Her Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Not just Okonogi, but Her Majesty, too?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you certain about this?”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“They reportedly overheard an argument about what should be done with Her Majesty between Governor-General Warren and his daughter Elsa.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Warren determined that Okonogi and Her Majesty were accomplices in crime.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“In the coming days, he plans to invoke the authority of the Government-General to have Her Majesty executed!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A regular family quarrel, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Warren really might go through with it.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He could be taking this as an opportunity to remake the Imperial government.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Republic doesn't generally let the countries it occupies retain their governments.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Warren has probably always planned to topple the Imperial government eventually.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Empire has always been the exception to the rule, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"That means Kanami could be killed as early as today.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"She said she would atone one day for impersonating the Empress, but there is a grave difference between choosing death and having it forced upon you.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"And while accepting death at an Imperial's hand might be one thing, it is intolerable that she should die by a\nRepublican's.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"As her family, I will not stand for it.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"The warriors around us begin arguing the issue at once.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"─Do we rescue her or not?",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"─Are we even realistically capable of rescuing her?",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"─In the first place, is Empress Hisui real or an impostor?",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"The general consensus seems to be leaning towards rescuing her.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"It seems that many warriors still refuse to believe that Empress Hisui is an impostor.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, Soujin, c'mere.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Akari beckons us over to a secluded corner.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've already made up your mind, haven't you, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You guessed correctly. I'm going to go save Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But it's out of the question to mobilize the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Government-General is on high alert. Charging in with all our forces would be beyond reckless.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I completely agree.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's why I'm going to go alone.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Hotori stares at me, her lips drawn into a thin line.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"The Hotori who was acting chairman would probably have insisted that she come along too.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"And indeed, we did infiltrate the Imperial Palace together to try and rescue Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"But now, Hotori understands the role that she has to fulfill.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"I turn to meet Akari's gaze next.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As Empress Hisui's vassal, I suppose it only goes without saying that you'd go and rescue her.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But let me make one thing clear.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What now?”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I only agreed to serve Kanami because restoring the Empire was my utmost priority.”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So strictly speaking, I wouldn't say that I abandoned─”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah, you don't have to spell it all out! Learn to let a girl sulk a little!”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How small-minded do you think I am, you jerk?”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You should know by now that I'd never doubt your fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"Akari's pout is eventually replaced by a knowing smile.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if you didn't serve her, you should still go and save Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isn't that what it means to be family?”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And besides, I need her to hear what I have to say.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"The smile vanishes from Akari's face.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Until recently, Kanami... or rather, Empress Hisui really grated on my nerves.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But having gotten all these chances to talk to her, I've changed my mind.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you set my lineage aside, the people's true Empress\nisn't me. It's been Kanami all along.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In the wake of all that suffering following the war, she was the one who protected the hearts of the people.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She was doing my job while I was playing at blade arts back in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And so, I'm very grateful to her.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She deserves to be forgiven for impersonating the Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Akari says all this with a gentle, matter-of-fact expression.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"My heart overflows with gratitude at her mercy.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I want to be able to tell her all this face-to-face.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, bring her back to me.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"I bow deeply at my lord's orders.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Then it's decided.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let's tell them about our plan.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
